{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 4150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 2649, "text": "I just talked to Harry."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 6790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4850, "text": "He's going to be out sick for a few more\ndays."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 10910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 7330, "text": "Well, obviously he didn't try the\nchicken soup I dropped off. His flu"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 11910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10910, "text": "gone by now."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 13250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12010, "text": "Oh, no, his flu is gone."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 15130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 13630, "text": "Now he's got food poisoning."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 20330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17690, "text": "A glorious Monday to you all."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 23650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21090, "text": "Another wild weekend with Mother Teresa."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 28370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25790, "text": "That is Mary Teresa, Mac."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 30830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 29830, "text": "And this."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 34460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31160, "text": "is all that's left of our in -room\njacuzzi at Barney's Bed and Bubble."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 43040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 40720, "text": "You know, you've been seeing this girl\nfor a few weeks now."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 46200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 43340, "text": "This is the longest one -night stand\nyou've ever had."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 47940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 46660, "text": "In fact, how crass."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 54280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 48360, "text": "Mary Teresa is a sweet, kind -hearted\nsoul who takes pleasure in my interest"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 55640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 54280, "text": "pleasure in my company."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 59520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 56720, "text": "Sorry. Besides, she carries an air\nmattress in her purse."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 63239, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 62320, "text": "Hi, girls."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 64240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 63240, "text": "Been out shopping?"}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 66240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64440, "text": "Nope. Mosaic class."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 71260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66940, "text": "Well, Ross, that sounds like something\nyou'd never do in a million years."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 76000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72300, "text": "Ross and I are swapping hobbies so we\ncan become more fully realized human"}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 77000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76000, "text": "beings."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 82340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 77660, "text": "Tomorrow I'm introducing her to an art\nform that expands the mind and drenches"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 84080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82340, "text": "the soul in spiritual ecstasy."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 85940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 84280, "text": "Ah, crossbow class."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 88800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 87800, "text": "Bullseye."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 90760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 89160, "text": "Come on, Rog. Let's see your mosaic."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 92300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 91020, "text": "Yeah, let's see it, Rog. Come on."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 95180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 93180, "text": "Okay, you asked for it."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 101900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 99020, "text": "Wow, what a beautiful seascape."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 104480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 102160, "text": "The waves lapping against the shore."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 108280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 104800, "text": "Tiny sea otters at play as the sun sets\non the lone lighthouse."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 111380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 110360, "text": "How peaceful."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 113860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 112340, "text": "You hold it upside down."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 119170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 116430, "text": "It's a six -car pileup on the Long\nIsland Expressway."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 167250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 165290, "text": "Six -inch stilettos."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 170170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 167870, "text": "Ah, Mary Teresa."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 178110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 176570, "text": "So that's Mary Teresa."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 180030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 178490, "text": "Wow, what a knockout."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 182910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 180510, "text": "So, you work in the stinking dump?"}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 187270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 185290, "text": "Yes, and what a little charmer."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 190590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 188710, "text": "You left this in my car."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 195630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 192270, "text": "I figured you'd want to recharge it for\nour date tomorrow."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 200230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 196110, "text": "Well, sure, I wouldn't want to run out\nof juice in the middle of dusting."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 207370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 206370, "text": "Ciao, baby."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 214330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 213330, "text": "Wow."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 216570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 215570, "text": "Nice girl."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 221150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 219070, "text": "Dan, Dan, do you know her last name?"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 225500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 221899, "text": "No, but I know she likes to sit in\nbutter."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 230740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227600, "text": "Well, if you'd been keeping up with the\nnews, you'd know who she is. That's"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 231740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 230740, "text": "Loverboy's daughter."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 236660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 233060, "text": "What Loverboy? I mean, the only Loverboy\nI know is the mob boss, Joey Loverboy"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 237980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 236660, "text": "Schiavelli. Exactly."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 240340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239000, "text": "Wait a minute, that couldn't be."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 244440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 240800, "text": "That would mean I have been taking\nincredibly foul liberties with the"}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 246500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 244440, "text": "of the second biggest crime lord in the\ncity."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 249940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 247160, "text": "Dan, a word to the wise, I'd break it\noff if I were you."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 251840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 250840, "text": "Good idea."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 255480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 252000, "text": "I'll break it off before he breaks it\noff."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 261399, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 258380, "text": "Well, if it isn't our little hobby\nswapper back from the crossbow range."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 262499, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 261600, "text": "How'd it go?"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 264180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262500, "text": "Oh, not well."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 266880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 265060, "text": "Oh, what happened?"}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 273980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268880, "text": "Well, Ross kind of stepped down range to\nfix the target, and I kind of was"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 276420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273980, "text": "holding the crossbow, and I kind of\npulled..."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 282430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281390, "text": "Kind of get hurt?"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 286550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 283230, "text": "Kind of. The arrow got Roz in the\nderriere."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 289950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 288570, "text": "You shot her in the hat?"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 293050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 292050, "text": "I wish."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 295270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294270, "text": "Me too."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 299770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296330, "text": "Then maybe I'd be able to sit down\nwithout swallowing my teeth."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 304530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 303530, "text": "You're not mad."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 306310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 305310, "text": "Accidents happen."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 309690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306390, "text": "Who knows? Maybe tomorrow at the range\nit could be Lisette."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 320530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 319150, "text": "I think you misunderstood her."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 325090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320910, "text": "Maybe so, but just in case, I'm going to\ngo buy some arrow -proof panties."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 335850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 329750, "text": "Oh, hey, Matt. Yeah? Good news. I'm 86th\nMary Teresa. Yeah? Well, if anybody can"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 338190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335850, "text": "dump a woman like a bag of trash, it's\nDan Fielding."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 340610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339610, "text": "Thank you, friend."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 345070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341350, "text": "Boy, I shudder to think how close I came\nto getting mixed up with that gang of"}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 346570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 345070, "text": "leg -breaking thugs, you know?"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 348450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347330, "text": "Daniel Fielding."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 349890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348890, "text": "Yeah, who wants to know?"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 351590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 350450, "text": "Joseph Schiavelli."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 356890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 352450, "text": "And you are?"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 358490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 357370, "text": "Out of here. Bye."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 368070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361990, "text": "Mr. Schiavelli, I, uh, I, I, I, I...\nFielding, I do not wish to waste your"}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 369410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 368130, "text": "so I'll get right to the point."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 371650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 369870, "text": "I understand you've been seeing my\ndaughter."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 373530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 372530, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 375590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 374350, "text": "I don't know if I take seeing."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 378780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 376280, "text": "Why, more like, you know, calling\naround. Hey, like buddies."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 384460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380820, "text": "Ah, but she tells me that you wish to be\nbuddies no longer."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 387100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 386100, "text": "She did."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 389080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 388080, "text": "Silly goose."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 391140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389960, "text": "Can't you tell when I'm kidding?"}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 398700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 391760, "text": "You see, I've been through this with\nMary Teresa's other suitors."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 402520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 399000, "text": "For some reason, they all seem to\ndisappear."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 405480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 404480, "text": "Imagine that."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 412470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 407290, "text": "Now, finally, she meets a fine,\nupstanding man, a district attorney, no"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 415170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 412670, "text": "and he, too, exits her life."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 419170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416050, "text": "Can you imagine the guilt I am feeling?"}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 422170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420050, "text": "Oh, your pain is my pain, sir."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 428670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 425690, "text": "Then help me get over this ache in my\nheart."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 430990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429030, "text": "Come to dinner at my home Friday."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 434470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 431410, "text": "Make my little flower happy, huh?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 435790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 434790, "text": "Dinner!"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 440570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 436630, "text": "I'd love to, but my sister's in town. I\npromised I'd have dinner with her. Look,"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 441590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 440590, "text": "here she is now."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 444250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 441750, "text": "Mr. Schiavelli, meet my sister, Cookie."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 447830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446830, "text": "Cookie?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 450130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 449130, "text": "Cookie?"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 451970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450510, "text": "Hey, what a coincidence."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 455350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452450, "text": "That was the name of my dear late wife."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 457370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 455910, "text": "May she rest in peace."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 462160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459110, "text": "Cookie? I was just telling Mr.\nSchiavelli about our plans Friday night"}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 464740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 462160, "text": "couldn't possibly desert you on your\nvery last night in town, even though it"}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 466100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 464740, "text": "would be peachy to have dinner at his\nhouse, right?"}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 468900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467900, "text": "Cookie."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 471360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470260, "text": "Say no more."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 475440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 471700, "text": "If anyone understands the importance of\nfamily, it is I."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 477740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 476260, "text": "You must both come."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 480380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 478040, "text": "Huh? No, please, I insist."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 482740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 481000, "text": "Baldo will contact you Friday."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 485020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 484020, "text": "Friday."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 487060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486060, "text": "Cookie."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 492000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 488919, "text": "I've spent far too many nights alone."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 502120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 499060, "text": "How could you do that to me? He's the\nnumber two crime boss in this city."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 504380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 502340, "text": "Yes, again, now he's number one with a\nbullet."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 506980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505980, "text": "Well, I gotta do something."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 510180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507380, "text": "Maybe we should call the FBI. They could\nhelp us. Oh, yeah, right after that, we"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 512080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 510180, "text": "can call the morgue, ask them to reserve\nus a slab."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 517240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 515340, "text": "You did the right thing in contacting\nthe Bureau."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 518659, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 517659, "text": "I think we can help."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 520980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 518820, "text": "So then you've handled this kind of\nthing before?"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 524900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 521340, "text": "Well, actually, um... Uh, no."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 527040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525980, "text": "This is my first gig."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 529540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 527280, "text": "I, uh, just graduated from the academy."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 535380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532700, "text": "Agent DiLorenzo, do we really have to go\nto this dinner?"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 537520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 536020, "text": "You? No. You? Yes."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 540000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 537980, "text": "You're on special assignment for the\nDA's office."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 543080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540220, "text": "And I might add, your superiors were\nmost anxious to see you go."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 549900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 547400, "text": "You know, the Bureau's been trying to\npin something on Schiavelli for a long"}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 552780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 549900, "text": "time. You could be the break we've been\nwaiting for. Oh, come on, what break?"}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 555400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 552880, "text": "He's just trying to marry off his\ndaughter and give himself a little cheap"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 556400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 555400, "text": "on the side."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 557540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 556540, "text": "Dad!"}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 559360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 557740, "text": "All right, all right, a lot of cheap\nsex."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 563200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 562120, "text": "That's not the way we see it."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 567860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563420, "text": "You see, last month, Schiavelli lost his\nconsigliere to a bathtub accident."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 570760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 568620, "text": "Ew. Did someone electrocute him?"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 572500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 571080, "text": "No, he slipped on a bar of soap."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 574620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573620, "text": "It happens."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 580660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 576440, "text": "We figure that Schiavelli is out to\nreplace him, Counselor."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 585780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 581500, "text": "What? Me? Why not? You're a seasoned\nattorney with a solid track record and a"}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 587240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 585780, "text": "long history of moral depravity."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 591340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589360, "text": "Not to mention a complete lack of\nethics."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 593040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592040, "text": "Hey, you're funny."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 594640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 593200, "text": "Schiavelli likes that in his mistresses."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 599560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 596620, "text": "Mistresses? Okay, that's it. I am not\ngoing."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 601800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 599780, "text": "Relax. You won't be in any danger."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 603700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 602000, "text": "You're not the one who has to wear the\nwire."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 607260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606260, "text": "The wire?"}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 609960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 607760, "text": "Yeah. So we can listen in?"}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 611260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 610260, "text": "You know, evidence?"}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 615680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612440, "text": "What, you think we were just going to\nask for an essay on how I spent my mob"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 616680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 615680, "text": "dinner?"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 618800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 617800, "text": "Christine."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 621720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620720, "text": "Okay, Dan."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 624620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 622680, "text": "Whatever happens, I'll be there with\nyou."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 626660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 625400, "text": "And then I'm going to kill you."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 628720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 627200, "text": "I'll take a number. Cookie."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 644990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 641449, "text": "Lizette, why didn't you show up at the\nrange today?"}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 649530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645450, "text": "Well, you know what they say, an eye for\nan eye, a cheek for a cheek."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 653210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 651290, "text": "Lizette, I told you I forgave you."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 657630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653570, "text": "Besides, you shouldn't give up so\neasily. The best thing to do in these"}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 659470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657630, "text": "to get right back up on the horse."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 660729, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659770, "text": "It is?"}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 663490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660730, "text": "Yes. I'll see you at the range tomorrow\nmorning."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 675130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 673569, "text": "becoming strangely medieval."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 681930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 679750, "text": "Okay, Mr. Fielding, you're wired for\nsound."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 685450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 682750, "text": "Wow, you are a brave fan, Dan."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 689950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685890, "text": "I just read about a guy who was rubbed\nout by the mob after his wires started"}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 691090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689950, "text": "smoking. Oh."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 693450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692430, "text": "The Ludlow case."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 697910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 693670, "text": "What a mess. What do you mean, meth?"}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 699930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 698490, "text": "What do you mean, yuck?"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 702750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701570, "text": "Relax, Mr. Fielding."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 707440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 703080, "text": "The late Mr. Ludlow's wire did\nmalfunction, but only because he was a"}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 709740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 707900, "text": "Come to think of it, he was also a\nbleeder."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 712720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710640, "text": "So you're saying if I sweat, I died?"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 718500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713360, "text": "Just try to stay calm. And if you do\nfeel a trickle, think cool thoughts like"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 720820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 718500, "text": "Iceland or ice cream."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 722620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 721440, "text": "Or ice pick."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 727560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724740, "text": "Thank you for your kind thoughts, Mac.\nYou're so helpful."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 729480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 728480, "text": "You're welcome."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 733080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 731199, "text": "Okay, Mr. Fielding, a few last -minute\ntips."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 736960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733400, "text": "Avoid all physical contact so nobody\nwill feel the wire. No, don't bend over."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 738320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 737100, "text": "That could jostle the microphone."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 742340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 738840, "text": "Sit close to Schiavelli to make sure\nthat the mic picks up his voice. And"}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 745020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742340, "text": "whatever you do, don't mention Brooklyn."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 747680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 746680, "text": "Brooklyn? Why not?"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 749420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 747980, "text": "Trust me, you don't want to know."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 752180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 750220, "text": "Um, uh, what about me?"}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 754000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 753000, "text": "Your hair looks nice."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 757000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 755220, "text": "No, I mean, is there anything I should\nkeep in mind?"}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 759340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 757240, "text": "You? Just go and have a good time."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 761060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 760060, "text": "Sweat all you want."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 765840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 764840, "text": "Ice capades."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 767220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 766220, "text": "Ice pack."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 769280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 767500, "text": "I certainly hope I'm alive tomorrow."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 775240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 773320, "text": "You have a lovely home, Mr. Schiavelli."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 776660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 775560, "text": "Please, Joseph."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 778900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 777900, "text": "Joseph."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 784400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 779280, "text": "I was just wondering why a man would\nhave so many TVs and stereos. I mean,"}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 786980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 784400, "text": "must have had at least 40 piled up in\nthis bare bedroom alone."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 788400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787400, "text": "Christine."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 789620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 788620, "text": "Christine."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 792780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 790099, "text": "It was Cookie's nickname when we were\nkids."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 794000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 793000, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 797800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 794600, "text": "What are you doing? I just want to help\nyou get him on tape. Don't help."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 800800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 798340, "text": "So, what do you think of my home,\ncounselor?"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 802260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 801260, "text": "Huh?"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 807140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 805560, "text": "Don't you use cloth napkins."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 809140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 807820, "text": "Paper's fine for these people."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 814600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 810940, "text": "This is my soon -to -be -sainted mother,\nAngela Schiavelli."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 816680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815680, "text": "Mama."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 818740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 817000, "text": "This is Daniel Fielding, Mr."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 819940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818940, "text": "District Attorney."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 823140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 820000, "text": "And this here is his sister, Cookie."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 827140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 823420, "text": "Another Cookie, huh? And this one's a\nshowgirl, too."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 831120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 828920, "text": "Showgirl? What makes you think I'm a\nshowgirl?"}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 832920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 831920, "text": "Two guesses."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 838580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 835480, "text": "Does somebody in this room owe me an\napology?"}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 850730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 844490, "text": "Can you ever forgive me my delicate\nlittle snowflake? Oh, Danny boy, come"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 851730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 850730, "text": "and give me a hug."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 853150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 852150, "text": "Oh,"}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 856570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 854670, "text": "you're shy in front of my daddy."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 858970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 856990, "text": "Oh, that is so cute."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 862730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861730, "text": "Who are you?"}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 869630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 863650, "text": "Oh, Mary Teresa, please say hi to my\nsister, Cookie. Oh, your sister, huh?"}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 873330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 869850, "text": "Oh, gosh, she's cute, Danny. When's she\nleaving town?"}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 875790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 874350, "text": "Not too soon, I hope."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 877390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876390, "text": "Let's eat."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 881410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 879370, "text": "Come, Cookie, you sit next to me, huh?"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 885870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 881730, "text": "Oh, no, you know, I better sit next to\nyou. She is such a messy eater."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 887290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 886290, "text": "I am not."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 891730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887370, "text": "Just call me Little Miss Pigpen."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 898050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 895870, "text": "Isn't Baldo going to sit down?"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 900170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 898910, "text": "Baldo never sits."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 902050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901050, "text": "Never."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 904180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 903180, "text": "Waldo stands."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 906240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905240, "text": "Stands."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 910980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 907660, "text": "So, Mrs. Chiavelli, I'm really looking\nforward to a nice home -cooked meal."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 913780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 911420, "text": "Then you better go home. We're having\nChinese."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 918360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 917360, "text": "Except for me."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 920760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 918960, "text": "I'm on a diet, doctor's orders."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 922960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 921260, "text": "I've even taken up the life cycle."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 926500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 924440, "text": "It increases my stamina."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 930140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 929140, "text": "That's nice."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 933100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930920, "text": "Oh, yeah, right, the life cycle."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 934940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 933340, "text": "He had Baldo ride it for him."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 939200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 936620, "text": "That's right. Hey, Baldo, how many miles\nI do today?"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 940520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 939520, "text": "Only three, boss."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 941499, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 940760, "text": "How come?"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 943080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941500, "text": "I pulled my calf muscle."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 950300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 945600, "text": "He has"}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 952920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950300, "text": "scolioliitis."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 955280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953940, "text": "What is that?"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 959860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 957480, "text": "That's when two scolios..."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 961720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 960140, "text": "Uh, get cut off."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 963840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 962840, "text": "I'll get it."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 968280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 965240, "text": "Uh, you know, Mr. Schiavelli, I must say\nthat you and my sister make a lovely"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 969280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 968280, "text": "couple."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 971300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 970300, "text": "Oh,"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 974100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972460, "text": "there's blood on that fork."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 976540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974960, "text": "That washes right off."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 978020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977020, "text": "Trust me."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 982380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981380, "text": "That was delicious."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 987100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 982880, "text": "Sure beats the hell out of those\nmidnight buffets in Atlantic City. Eh,"}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 991800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 989320, "text": "Billy, I think you have the wrong idea.\nI'm not a showgirl."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 995300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 992820, "text": "So then, Cookie, what is it that you do?"}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 998020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 995700, "text": "Well, actually, I'm a... Lingerie model."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1002720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1001440, "text": "Marry this one, Sonny."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1004280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1003180, "text": "She's a career girl."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1007900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1006140, "text": "We can make it a double ceremony."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1010920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1009280, "text": "Well, maybe so, but a couple."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1014720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1011820, "text": "Now, if you'll excuse us, we have some\nman talk to do."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1016750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1015750, "text": "We do?"}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1020470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1017610, "text": "In that case, Cookie, come on. Let's go\nmake some girl talk."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1024810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1021130, "text": "You know the little twerp down at the\nbeauty parlor? I'd like to bust his"}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1025810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1024810, "text": "stinking face."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1032270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029589, "text": "Give Ellie, please. Let me first say\nthat it's been a pleasure. How much?"}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1037530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1036530, "text": "How much what?"}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1039030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1037810, "text": "How much money do you want?"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1041430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040430, "text": "I don't know."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1047500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1046160, "text": "Fifty dollars would be nice."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1052280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1049000, "text": "Shoot. I meant fifty thousand."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1055960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1054020, "text": "Fifty thousand would be better."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1060420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1059000, "text": "What are we talking about?"}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1066100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061220, "text": "We are talking about how much it will\ntake to keep you away from my daughter."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1067640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066640, "text": "Huh?"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1073020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1068460, "text": "We've done some checking up on you. To\nput it mildly, you have the morals of a"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1074020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1073020, "text": "rutting pig."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1081720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1078380, "text": "No, wait, hold a second. I don't have to\nsit here and be insulted. $75 ,000."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1083680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1081720, "text": "Maybe I could say this for an espresso\nand I'd be okay."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1089640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1085580, "text": "$75 ,000 just to stay away from your\ndaughter?"}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1098380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1092040, "text": "So, what you're saying is strictly\npersonal, just between you and me and"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1100780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1098380, "text": "else, and is completely legal."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1104020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102140, "text": "Why are you talking to your tie?"}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1106920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1105920, "text": "Hey, boss."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1109410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107230, "text": "I smell smoke, but your cigar ain't lit."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1122230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115370, "text": "Actually smells more like burning"}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1123230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1122230, "text": "flesh."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1126010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1123490, "text": "And no one knows burning flesh like you,\nboss."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1135170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1134170, "text": "Kidney stones."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1143719, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1142800, "text": "$100 ,000?"}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1145180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1143720, "text": "If that's your price."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1150280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1146640, "text": "$100 ,000? I don't know."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1155240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1152680, "text": "She's become real special to me."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1157100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156100, "text": "Hop."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1160740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1158560, "text": "All right, $150 ,000."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1162720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161720, "text": "$150 ,000?"}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1168360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163960, "text": "Wire! Wire? What wire? Wire? What wire?"}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1171100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168560, "text": "My kidney's bothering me so hard!"}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1184220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1183220, "text": "$200 ,000?"}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1187460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185560, "text": "And not a penny more."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1191660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189200, "text": "Stop! Before you do anything to Dan, I\nhave to tell you something."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1193220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192220, "text": "He's gay."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1194720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1193720, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1197360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1195640, "text": "I'm sorry, Dan. I just thought they\nshould know the truth."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1199040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1197680, "text": "Oh, Daddy!"}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1200499, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199600, "text": "Come here, buddy."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1202960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1200500, "text": "What are you doing? I heard screaming. I\nthought they were trying to pressure"}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1203960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1202960, "text": "you into marrying her."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1206100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205000, "text": "I'm not gay."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1208580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1207400, "text": "Yes, you are."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1212400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209120, "text": "That explains why sex with you was so,\nso"}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1214320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213320, "text": "so hollow."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1217300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1214780, "text": "You had sex with my daughter?"}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1219380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1217780, "text": "No! No!"}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1221560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1219940, "text": "And it was not hollow."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1225800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1221960, "text": "And all this time, he was pretending I\nwas a man."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1229580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1227820, "text": "So, Mr."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1233420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1229820, "text": "Hotshot, the year you try to shake down\nthe boss for 200 grand, huh?"}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1235220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1233740, "text": "200 grand?"}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1236520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1235520, "text": "That's..."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1246580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1241660, "text": "Dishonored my daughter and my family.\nGod forbid Mama heard this over the"}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1251680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1246580, "text": "dishwasher. Couldn't we discuss this\nrationally? I can't be rational with a"}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1252680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251680, "text": "like this."}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1257620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1253460, "text": "Couldn't you just let him go, lover boy?"}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1261760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258760, "text": "Do it for me, for your little cookie."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1266460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1263940, "text": "She speaks, and I am putty."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1271620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1268460, "text": "Mr. Schiavelli, please, sir, I am sorry.\nListen, I don't want your money, and I"}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1272620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271620, "text": "don't want your daughter."}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1275520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1272680, "text": "Because of Cookie's graciousness, I\naccept your apology."}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1278060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1276500, "text": "Allow me to pay for your jacket."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1280670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278529, "text": "No, that's fine. I'll just take it to my\ntailor, Tony."}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1281930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1280930, "text": "Tony from Queens?"}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1283110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1282110, "text": "No, Tony from Brooklyn."}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1284950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1283690, "text": "Brooklyn? Uh -oh."}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1287610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1285490, "text": "Hal, you just said the secret word."}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1291370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1287870, "text": "Why, you slimy little toad. You know\nwhat happened to me in Brooklyn?"}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1292630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1291570, "text": "Something unpleasant."}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1297130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1292870, "text": "My own brother put a hit on me in my\nfavorite restaurant, but I got him back."}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1298330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1297270, "text": "Him and them other traders."}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1299550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298550, "text": "You know what I did?"}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1303750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1299590, "text": "I put 30 bullets into Joe's scuff marks.\nHe won't be shining them shoes no more."}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1307990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1303890, "text": "I dropped any of the hook from his own\nbell tower. Then I rang the stinking"}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1309630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1307990, "text": "to tell the devil he was coming."}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1312010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1310250, "text": "You know what I did to Frankie\nBessaloni?"}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1316510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312350, "text": "I took a pair of garden shears to his...\nOh, it's midnight!"}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1324610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1319690, "text": "There goes my ride."}
{"cue": 375, "end_ms": 1328350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1327350, "text": "Cookie."}
{"cue": 376, "end_ms": 1331270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1329870, "text": "I'll call you. We'll see a show, maybe."}
{"cue": 377, "end_ms": 1333250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1332250, "text": "Maybe."}
{"cue": 378, "end_ms": 1337610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1335630, "text": "Well, you seem to be in one piece."}
{"cue": 379, "end_ms": 1341150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1338190, "text": "I guess Roz didn't buzz out your behind\nafter all."}
{"cue": 380, "end_ms": 1342930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1341470, "text": "She never got the chance."}
{"cue": 381, "end_ms": 1345730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1344150, "text": "You act like you shot her again."}
{"cue": 382, "end_ms": 1347030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1346030, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 383, "end_ms": 1349370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1348310, "text": "You didn't."}
{"cue": 384, "end_ms": 1350670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1349670, "text": "I did."}
{"cue": 385, "end_ms": 1352090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1351090, "text": "Same place."}
{"cue": 386, "end_ms": 1361660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1359760, "text": "Anybody says a word and they're dead\nmeat."}
